   "source": [
    "# Renewable Energy Sources in India\n",
    "## Data science project | State-level capacity analysis and estimation\n",
    "\n",
    "**Repository name:** `Renewable_Energy_Sources_in_India`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Project objective:** Explore the supplied state-year renewable-energy dataset and build a supervised model that estimates each state/region's total installed renewable capacity for the next year.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dataset:** 635 records, 10 original columns, 34 states/regions, 2006–2024.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Prediction target:** Sum of the five renewable technology capacity columns. The source file does not specify the capacity unit; all numeric results therefore retain the dataset's original unit.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Validation:** Train on eligible rows through 2021 and test on 2022–2024. This is a rolling one-year-ahead backtest: each test row uses the actual immediately previous year as its lag input.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
